# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend build-time configuration
#
# You almost certainly do not need this file.
#
# Suvidha deploys as a single service: the Node server builds and serves this
# frontend, so everything is same-origin and every request is relative. Leave
# VITE_SERVER_URL empty and it stays that way.
#
# The one case for setting it is hosting the frontend separately from the
# server. If you do, it must be https:// - a page served over https cannot open
# a ws:// socket, and the browser error does not mention mixed content. The app
# detects that specific mistake and shows a banner rather than failing silently.
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* variables into the bundle at build time, so whatever you
# put here is public. Never a secret.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

VITE_SERVER_URL=
